-          <span class="key"><span class="badge guarded">guarded</span></span>
-          <span class="txt"><b>Guarded verifier</b> — its runtime check reads data the next statement type drops (a sumcheck target, a packed value); it may <span class="mono">failure</span> at runtime and composes via <span class="mono">▷ₑᵍ</span>.</span>
